        <dc:contributor>Joe Gregory</dc:contributor>
        <dc:creator>SIE Disruption Lab</dc:creator>
        <dc:description>A library description defining the canonical instances of GRLPhase, GRLLevel, and AssessmentThread for the General Readiness Level (GRL) framework. Provides the three phases (Foundation, Development, Operational), nine GRL levels (GRL-1 through GRL-9), and six canonical assessment threads (T, P, I, H, O, K). Source: WRT-2516 v2, Chapter 6.</dc:description>
        <dc:hasVersion>0.1</dc:hasVersion>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


